nctive bird songs of many of our local species doug jones thu 12052011 749pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('150','en','node_search',' buriton s link with dominase more good news buriton s link with dominase more good news cschtoilet20jpg as well as the successful completion of a number of pilot toilets for individual households in dominase the latrine block at the marfo junior secondary school in dominase has now been officially opened doug jones fri 13052011 538pm  ','0'),('153','en','node_search',' new piglets new piglets 8pigletssmalljpg 15 piglets 2 litters have been born in the last few weeks they are oxford sandy and blacks visitors are welcome anonymous not verified tue 17052011 1119am  ','0'),('155','en','node_search',' buriton post office buriton post office buritonpostoffice22smalljpg the post office is open every friday 130 330pm in the seward room next to st mary s church you do not have to queue well you do very occasionally but even that is enjoyable and you are treated to a cup of coffee or tea and some healthy gossip anonymous not verified fri 20052011 330pm  ','0'),('156','en','node_search',' buriton village show buriton village show our traditional village show will be held on saturday 20th august 2011 and will concentrate on horticultural and craft classes including baking fruit vegetables flowers photography and much more for further details contact maggie johnston on 1730 262293 doug jones sat 28052011 523pm  ','0'),('157','en','node_search',' fun and funds from quiz night fun and funds from quiz night cimg2355jpg buriton s alternative quiz night on 14th may was a huge success providing fun for participants and funding for our link with dominase doug jones sat 28052011 602pm  ','0'),('158','en','node_search',' buriton christian aid 2011 buriton christian aid 2011 christianaidjpg christian aid housetohouse collections throughout the parish raised a total of 82755 this year admin wed 1062011 109pm  ','0'),('159','en','node_search',' the nest hotel restaurant the nest hotel restaurant village innjpg admin wed 1062011