8092011 1001am  ','0'),('196','en','node_search','  bygone buriton exhibition praised by visitors from as far away as australia  bygone buriton exhibition praised by visitors from as far away as australia cedit8jpg buriton s fascinating history was brought to life in a special exhibition on saturday september 24th and the event attracted visitors from as far away as australia doug jones mon 26092011 204pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('197','en','node_search',' farm walk starts with a tipple farm walk starts with a tipple cimg3972jpg almost 50 parishioners family and friends enjoyed a fascinating and informative farm walk on sunday 25th september thanks to farm manager oliver howe of weston farm doug jones mon 26092011 209pm  ','0'),('200','en','node_search',' a leg at each corner fresh pork available from friday 14th october a leg at each corner fresh pork available from friday 14th october alaeclogoburitoninfojpg more information can be found on the web site  wwwalegateachcornercom  anonymous not verified wed 5102011 625pm  ','0'),('201','en','node_search',' fungi foray finds threatened species fungi foray finds threatened species fungi2011img2482cjpg the latest guided walks in buriton s chalk pits nature reserves discovered a rare fungus which appears on the red data list of threatened british fungi doug jones thu 13102011 1002pm  ','0'),('202','en','node_search',' better broadband for buriton  better broadband for buriton  broadbandnetworks32jpg the government has awarded over 8 million to hampshire county council to improve broadband access for rural communities but buriton will probably only get some of the money if we do something about it doug jones thu 13102011 1035pm  ','0'),('203','en','node_search',' want something different for christmas  want something different for christmas  pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau ever struggle with christmas gift ideas dislike the christmas madness on the high street  doug jones thu 13102011 1048pm  ','0'),('204','en','node_search',' new volunteer group begins to make a difference new volunteer group begins to make a difference cimg4585jpg a new group of volunteers has begun to look after parts of the chalk pits nature reserve but there is still time for more people to join the working party  doug jones mon 7112011 655pm  ','0'),('205','en','node_search',' art for all art for all websiteartforalltof