fe from her childhood to the present day doug jones sat 31122011 1225pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('236','en','node_search',' bygone buriton local history exhibition bygone buriton local history exhibition pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau hundreds of photographs of the parish in years gone by free exhibition in the village hall from 11am to 4pm doug jones sat 31122011 1237pm  ','0'),('237','en','node_search',' parish proms parish proms pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau sing along to some last night of the proms classics in the magnificent manor barn doug jones sat 31122011 1246pm  ','0'),('238','en','node_search',' tennis finals weekend tennis finals weekend pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau the first day of the tennis club s popular tournament finals come and watch some keenly contested matches the weekend will feature the finals of singles and doubles competitions doug jones sat 31122011 1251pm  ','0'),('239','en','node_search',' tennis finals weekend tennis finals weekend pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau the second day of the tennis club s popular tournament finals come and watch some keenly contested matches the weekend will feature the finals of singles and doubles competitions doug jones sat 31122011 1252pm  ','0'),('240','en','node_search',' village show village show pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau there will be lots of special attractions at the village show this year as well as all the traditional favourites doug jones sat 31122011 102pm  ','0'),('241','en','node_search',' olympic torch to pass through the parish  olympic torch to pass through the parish  pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau it is hoped that the olympic torch will pass through parts of the parish on monday 16th july as part of its journey from portsmouth to petersfield more details will be available nearer to the date doug jones sat 31122011 105pm  ','0'),('242','en','node_search',' buriton school fete buriton school fete pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau all the fun of the fete at buriton primary school doug jones sat 31122011 114pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('243','en','node_search',' open day at coulters dean nature reserve open day at coulters dean nature reserve pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau experts will be on hand to identify all the varieties of orchids and other rare plants which can be found in this small nature reserve on the south downs above buriton village visit any time from 10am to 1230pm contact di mitchell 1730 266064 or email dimartinburiton btinternetcom  for more information doug jones sat 31122011 201pm  ','0'),('244','en','node_search',' davis cup tennis competition davis cup tennis competition pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau the first day of buriton s own international tennis competition with club members representing a wide range of countries tennis giants and dwarfs team ghana won the 2011 tournament come and enjoy some exciting tennis and some fascinating fancy dress  doug jones sat 31122011 215pm  ','0'),('245','en','node_search',' davis cup tennis competition davis cup tennis competition pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau the second day of buriton s own international tennis competition with club members representing a wide range of countries tennis giants and dwarfs team ghana won the 2011 tournament come and enjoy some exciting tennis and some fascinating fancy dress  doug jones sat 31122011 216pm  ','0'),('246','en','node_search',' farm open day farm open day pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau from 11am to 3pm activities and fun for all parishioners family and friends farm animals trailer rides agricultural machinery and a barbecue doug jones sat 31122011 244pm  ','0'),('248','en','node_search',' open day in buriton chalk pits open day in buriton chalk pits pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau activities for all age groups storytelling art activities family quizzes guided walks and a popular moth and bug hunt all free of charge in our local buriton chalk pits nature reserve doug jones sat 31122011 305pm  ','0'),('249','en','node_search',' buriton s alternative quiz night  buriton s alternative quiz night  pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau book your places now for buriton 39 s popular 39 alternative 39 quiz night 34 what the 34  doug jones sat 31122011 317pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('256','en','node_search',' spring clean litterpicking day spring clean litterpicking day pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau it s amazing how much litter accumulates along our lanes and hedgerows and how untidy it can make the parish look come and lend a hand on this annual spring clean saturday even just an hour will be a great help  doug jones sat 31122011 359pm  ','0'),('257','en','node_search',' chocolate lovers kick off successful appeal for dominase chocolate lovers kick off successful appeal for dominase webcocoamoonpictureaecompjpg buriton s innovative buy a bog christmas fund raising campaign raised over 600 with contributions from london northamptonshire and the lake district doug jones sat 31122011 405pm  ','0'),('261','en','node_search',' steps in the right direction steps in the right direction footpathworkers2012cejpg an enthusiastic group of volunteers have improved a popular countryside footpath in the parish making access to some wonderful views over the village much easier doug jones fri 13012012 511pm  ','0'),('262','en','node_search','  art for all   art for all  artistspalettejpg monday evenings 7pm to 9pm from 16th january 2012 fun and inspiring for everyone in the comfort of the five bells high street buriton gu31 5rx doug jones fri 13012012 518pm  ','0'),('263','en','node_search',' saving you money keeping you warm saving you money keeping you warm insulate2jpg east hampshire district council and hampshire county council have joined forces with other councils across the county to help householders install loft and cavitywall insulation to high standards anyone registering before 31st march 2012 is likely to get work done free of charge thereafter there will be some charges but they are likely to represent very good value full details are available via the website wwwinsulatehampshirecouk or by phoning 800 952 37 doug jones fri 13012012 531pm  ','0'),('264','en','node_search',' local beef can t be beaten local beef can t be beaten beefstoryimg4811cjpg that was the view of many of the people collecting their supplies of meat from susan shone at bolinge hill farm in january doug jones fri 13012012 559pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('265','en','node_search',' photos and stories are coming in for the buriton book of 2012 photos and stories are coming in for the buriton book of 2012 bookchurchjanuaryjpg as a unique souvenir of jubilee year a special fullcolour hardback book is being produced to record activities in the parish during the year a free copy of the book will be available for every household early in 2013 but your help is needed doug jones fri 13012012 619pm  ','0'),('267','en','node_search',' cricket match at home 2020 match against the ship inn cricket match at home 2020 match against the ship inn enjoy an exciting 2020 run chase and support your local village cricket team on the recreation ground starting at 6pm doug jones sun 12022012 706pm  ','0'),('268','en','node_search',' cricket match at home against elstead cricket match at home against elstead enjoy a leisurely afternoon supporting your local village cricket team on the recreation ground 2pm 7pm approximately  doug jones sun 12022012 708pm  ','0'),('269','en','node_search',' cricket match at home 2020 match against the red lion chalton  cricket match at home 2020 match against the red lion chalton enjoy an exciting 2020 run chase and support your local village cricket team on the recreation ground starting at 6pm  doug jones sun 12022012 711pm  ','0'),('270','en','node_search',' sponsored toddle for buy a bog campaign sponsored toddle for buy a bog campaign sponsoredtoddle1cejpg children parents helpers and friends of buriton nursery school took part in a sponsored toddle on friday 24th february on the village recreation ground and raised over 200  doug jones thu 16022012 415pm  ','0'),('271','en','node_search',' warnings about burglaries and digital switchover scams warnings about burglaries and digital switchover scams burglar2jpg rogue traders are reportedly cold calling in parts of hampshire claiming that residents need to replace their tv aerial in order to receive digital tv signals doug jones mon 20022012 134pm  ','0'),('272','en','node_search',' your chance to drop a clanger your chance to drop a clanger pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau 300 years ago on this very day the steeple on buriton church was struck by lightening and burnt down our team of bellringers will be ringing the bells to mark this anniversary they will also be giving demonstrations and providing parishioners with an opportunity to have a go doug jones wed 21032012 128pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('273','en','node_search',' from our own royal correspondent from our own royal correspondent pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau we are extremely fortunate in this diamond jubilee year to have the royal correspondent of one of our national newspapers living in the parish at the autumn meeting of the buriton village association richard palmer will give an insight into his work and a 39 behind the scenes 39 look at many of the royal events taking place during 2012 doug jones wed 21032012 131pm  ','0'),('274','en','node_search',' instant sunshine in the manor barn instant sunshine in the manor barn pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau an evening of comic song gently mocking the british way of life a bit of a coup for the village and possibly one of the last chances to enjoy one of buriton events evenings of fun in the manor barn doug jones wed 21032012 133pm  ','0'),('275','en','node_search',' events that have shaped our landscapes events that have shaped our landscapes pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau the unprecedented demand for wool and wheat during the napoleonic wars changed our local landscapes for ever doug jones wed 21032012 144pm  ','0'),('278','en','node_search',' harvest festival in st mary s church harvest festival in st mary s church pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau more details will be available nearer to the date of the event doug jones wed 21032012 149pm  ','0'),('280','en','node_search',' hunt for spiders in buriton chalk pits hunt for spiders in buriton chalk pits pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau experts will guide parishioners and visitors around the chalk pits nature reserve helping to identify a wide range of local spiders and their websites  doug jones wed 21032012 153pm  ','0'),('281','en','node_search',' farm walk at weston farm farm walk at weston farm pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau oliver howe will provide a guided walk around some of the fields and features of weston farm doug jones wed 21032012 156pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('282','en','node_search',' olympic walkathon by scores of schoolchildren olympic walkathon by scores of schoolchildren pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau in a special event to raise awareness about buriton 39 s sister community of dominase in rural ghana children from buriton primary school will walk half way to ditcham park school to meet pupils who have walked from there for a healthy snack picnic and to exchange olympic torch before returning to their own schools doug jones wed 21032012 159pm  ','0'),('283','en','node_search',' bat and moth hunt in buriton chalk pits bat and moth hunt in buriton chalk pits pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau experts will guide parishioners and visitors around the chalk pits nature reserve helping to identify bats and moths doug jones wed 21032012 204pm  ','0'),('284','en','node_search',' bat and moth hunt in buriton chalk pits bat and moth hunt in buriton chalk pits pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau experts will guide parishioners and visitors around the chalk pits nature reserve helping to identify bats and moths doug jones wed 21032012 205pm  ','0'),('285','en','node_search',' seniors tea at bolinge hill farm seniors tea at bolinge hill farm pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau a popular annual treat for senior citizens from across the parish book your places via the contact details below transport can be provided doug jones wed 21032012 208pm  ','0'),('286','en','node_search',' butterflies in buriton chalk pits postponed new details will appear when available  butterflies in buriton chalk pits postponed new details will appear when available  pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau experts will guide parishioners and visitors around the chalk pits nature reserve helping to identify local butterflies doug jones wed 21032012 210pm  ','0'),('287','en','node_search',' table top sale in the village hall table top sale in the village hall pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau make yourself a fortune by selling all your unwanted clutter or simply pop along between 11am and 330pm to buy yourself a bargain book your table for this popular event by contacting barbara muir 1730 231554 or barbaramuir btconnectcom doug jones wed 21032012 213pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('288','en','node_search','  parish campout on the recreation ground  parish campout on the recreation ground pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau all are welcome at buriton 39 s popular annual 39 campout 39 commencing from noon on friday 20th july camping overnight until the afternoon of saturday 21st doug jones wed 21032012 215pm  ','0'),('289','en','node_search',' council encourages more kissing council encourages more kissing kissinggateimg5318jpg regular walkers along the links at halls hill and in weston will have noticed that the parish council has been able to replace yet more awkward stiles with easytouse kissing gates doug jones wed 21032012 223pm  ','0'),('290','en','node_search',' buriton s special lambing lottery or sheepstake  buriton s special lambing lottery or sheepstake  lambinglottery20122jpg tickets were snapped up for buriton s innovative lambing lottery to try to win attractive cash prizes each of the ewes at nursted farm had been given their own secret number and the last ones to give birth to their lambs in the spring triggered cash prizes for three lucky people doug jones wed 21032012 226pm  ','0'),('291','en','node_search',' chalk pits truck arrives slowly chalk pits truck arrives slowly chalkpitstruckcimg5294jpg on a wet march morning an old truck was dragged up into the chalk pits from buriton pond for over 70 years trucks like this had hurtled around the site carrying chalk from the quarry faces down to the limeworks below doug jones wed 21032012 231pm  ','0'),('292','en','node_search',' diamond jubilee celebrations book your places at the street party now diamond jubilee celebrations book your places at the street party now streetparty2jpg plans for a day of festivities and fun in buriton on sunday 3rd june have been revealed in the parish magazine and bookings are needed for the street party so that the organisers know how many tables and chairs to obtain doug jones wed 21032012 240pm  ','0'),('301','en','node_search',' gentle south downs giant gentle south downs giant pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau a giant cycle around the gently undulating lanes of the south downs three circular routes for all levels of ability 44 76 and 102 miles buriton is just over halfway along the longest route the 102 milelong giant cyclists will pass through buriton from late morning onwards anonymous not verified thu 19042012 312pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('302','en','node_search',' can you help with the 2012 buriton fireworks display  can you help with the 2012 buriton fireworks display  imcejpeg if you can help in any way with this year s display then come and join the fireworks committee at the five bells in buriton on tuesday 8th may at 8pm admin sat 21042012 853pm  ','0'),('305','en','node_search',' tickets sold out for buriton s jubilee evening event tickets sold out for buriton s jubilee evening event 2012jubileeposterforwebsitecjpg dance to the live sounds of six decades of music at a right royal rave sunday 3rd june 730pm 11pm in buriton manor barn doug jones tue 24042012 1034pm  ','0'),('306','en','node_search',' operalympics operalympics pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau on the day that the olympic torch passes through part of the parish piers burtonpage limbers up for the games with a very surprising history of an olympic opera doug jones tue 8052012 910am  ','0'),('309','en','node_search',' great weather for snails great weather for snails chalkpitsactivitydayjpg wet weather brought an added bonus to buriton s chalk pits open day on saturday 28th april whilst some of the planned activities were switched indoors into the village hall a number of special discoveries were made on the bug hunting expeditions and guided walks doug jones tue 8052012 957am  ','0'),('310','en','node_search',' bluebell walk was obviously meant to be  bluebell walk was obviously meant to be  img5688cjpg despite days of wet weather susan shone s annual bluebell walk at bolinge hill farm took place as planned on sunday 29th april and it was obviously meant to be  doug jones tue 8052012 1001am  ','0'),('311','en','node_search',' villagers take a spin on electric bikes villagers take a spin on electric bikes electricbikes7ejpg organisers of a new scheme which is designed to help local pubs and businesses were delighted with the interest shown in buriton on saturday 28th april doug jones tue 8052012 1004am  ','0'),('313','en','node_search',' dominase day drums up lots of interest dominase day drums up lots of interest ralphdrumming10cjpg drumming lessons free samples of divine fairtrade chocolate and signed raffle prizes from comedy writer and actress miranda hart were amongst the attractions in the village hall but comfort appiah who had travelled all the way from dominase in ghana was the star of the show  doug jones sun 13052012 958pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('314','en','node_search',' the artist the artist pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau hugely popular comedy drama and multi award winner the next film in your village hall cinema doug jones sat 1092012 346pm  ','0'),('315','en','node_search',' the best exotic marigold hotel the best exotic marigold hotel pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau a popular comedydrama which follows a group of british retirees who decide to 39 outsource 39 their retirement to less expensive and seemingly exotic india doug jones sat 1092012 349pm  ','0'),('316','en','node_search',' war horse war horse pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau steven spielberg 39 s popular film about devon farmboy albert and his beloved horse joey doug jones sat 1092012 352pm  ','0'),('317','en','node_search',' salmon fishing in the yemen salmon fishing in the yemen pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau a comedydrama featuring a stuffy government scientist fred who is asked by a fishingobsessed arab sheik to do the seemingly impossible introduce british salmon to the wadis of the yemen doug jones sat 1092012 354pm  ','0'),('318','en','node_search',' anna karenina anna karenina pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau anna karenina is a classic drama joe wright directs the classic tolstoy story of marital infidelity in an adaptation by tom stoppard doug jones sat 1092012 357pm  ','0'),('319','en','node_search',' autumn films for 2012 autumn films for 2012 filmflyeredit233percentjpg an excellent series of films in buriton has been arranged for autumn 2012 with a series of recently acclaimed films  doug jones sat 1092012 409pm  ','0'),('320','en','node_search',' jubilee day so many memories jubilee day so many memories jubileeimg1664cjpg the weather was kind to buriton whilst rain was falling all around everything took place as planned enabling a host of happy memories from a thoroughly enjoyable day doug jones sat 1092012 419pm  ','0'),('321','en','node_search',' big farm open day at bolinge hill farm big farm open day at bolinge hill farm farmopendaycomp7img6583jpg a highlight of the community s down on our farms programme this year was susan shone s big farm open day doug jones sat 1092012 448pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('322','en','node_search',' tennis with a twist tennis with a twist tennisdaviscup2012ejpg even some heavy showers of rain couldn t detract from the enthusiasm of forty members of buriton tennis club as they enjoyed two days of nonstop tennis doug jones sat 1092012 450pm  ','0'),('323','en','node_search',' scrumptious spread at bolinge hill farm scrumptious spread at bolinge hill farm farmtea125jpg susan shone put on a special spread for seniors from across the parish in july an established part of the community s annual down on our farms programme of events open days walks and talks doug jones sat 1092012 453pm  ','0'),('324','en','node_search',' school walkathon for africa school walkathon for africa walkathon5jpg two hundred and fifty schoolchildren walked to meet together on the top of the south downs this month in a unique celebration to mark the olympic games and the schools links with rural ghana doug jones sat 1092012 455pm  ','0'),('325','en','node_search',' more great news about loos more great news about loos dominaseimg7284jpg over 350 children attend the primary and secondary schools in dompoase an outlying hamlet of dominase in rural ghana and until now they have not had anywhere private to go to the loo teenage girls would choose not to go to school for a few days every month missing out on vital learning doug jones sat 1092012 505pm  ','0'),('326','en','node_search',' parish proms a great night out parish proms a great night out p1070858cjpg  a great evening seems to be the overwhelming reaction to buriton s first ever parish proms held in the magnificent manor barn on sunday 9 september the event contained a mixture of humorous songs and albert hall favourites something for everybody and it provided another opportunity to wave those union jacks and bunting doug jones sat 1092012 508pm  ','0'),('327','en','node_search',' instant sunshine in the manor barn instant sunshine in the manor barn instantsunshineforwebc0jpg possibly one of the last chances to enjoy one of buriton events evenings of fun in the manor barn and a bit of a coup for the village with the visit of stars of radio tv and the edinburgh fringe instant sunshine  doug jones sat 22092012 1012am  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('328','en','node_search',' parish council minutes parish council minutes anonymous not verified sun 30092012 307pm parish council minutes of meetings ','0'),('329','en','node_search','  pig in a box is amongst bygone buriton highlights  pig in a box is amongst bygone buriton highlights 2734choppickerswestonjpg families from nine different counties in england and some from wales flocked to see buriton s annual local history exhibition on saturday 29th september 2012 mingling with residents and parishioners doug jones sun 30092012 328pm  ','0'),('330','en','node_search',' parish council parish council logo new 2024 c2jpg admin mon 1102012 933pm  ','0'),('331','en','node_search',' buriton wins county award buriton wins county award img8369ecjpg there was a pleasant surprise for the community recently when a buriton project scooped the top award at a special ceremony near winchester doug jones mon 8102012 1003pm  ','0'),('332','en','node_search',' buriton calendar for 2013 on sale now buriton calendar for 2013 on sale now calendar3cjpg copies of a brand new buriton parish calendar for 2013 are now available at only 7 per copy the new calendar makes a perfect christmas present for family and friends doug jones sat 13102012 433pm  ','0'),('333','en','node_search',' sunshine lights up memorable event in manor barn sunshine lights up memorable event in manor barn edit2cjpg applause rang out long and loud for the multitalented instant sunshine after their performance in the manor barn in late october doug jones wed 31102012 1148am  ','0'),('334','en','node_search',' come along and drop a clanger saturday november 17th 2 4pm  come along and drop a clanger saturday november 17th 2 4pm  bellringing2jpg exactly 300 years ago the church tower was struck by lightening and destroyed by fire buriton s bellringers will be marking this anniversary and they will also be giving people a chance to have a go at ringing the bells doug jones wed 31102012 1211pm  ','0'),('335','en','node_search',' seeing stars saturday 17th november 530pm  seeing stars saturday 17th november 530pm  pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau a special chance to see wonderful details on the moon and to be amazed by the beauty of orion 39 s sword experts from local astronomical groups will be bringing their telescopes to buriton on saturday 17 november and giving people an opportunity to look and learn doug jones wed 31102012 1214pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('336','en','node_search',' tennis club christmas party tennis club christmas party pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau members family and friends are all welcome to the tennis club s annual christmas party doug jones mon 19112012 1120am  ','0'),('337','en','node_search',' comedy night in village hall comedy night in village hall pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau something a bit special for the village and surrounding area an opportunity to have a good laugh to kickstart the christmas season doug jones mon 19112012 1140am  ','0'),('338','en','node_search',' carols round the pond carols round the pond pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau come and join the merry throng followed by mince pies refreshments and more carols in the church doug jones mon 19112012 1149am  ','0'),('339','en','node_search',' repairs to the village pond repairs to the village pond img8793cjpg some significant work will take place at and around the village pond during november with planting and finishing touches taking place in the spring of 2013 doug jones mon 19112012 1210pm  ','0'),('340','en','node_search',' ringing the changes ringing the changes bellringing2 jpg three hundred years ago buriton church was struck by lightning and partly destroyed by fire to mark the exact anniversary of the fateful day buriton s bellringers rang a quarter peal on the morning of saturday 17 november 2012 and in the afternoon gave a public demonstration with opportunities for anyone to have a go at ringing the bells doug jones mon 19112012 1226pm  ','0'),('341','en','node_search',' the solar system in fruit the solar system in fruit starparty1jpg cloudy skies meant that buriton s innovative stargazing party had to stay indoors but experts from hants astro turned st mary s church into a miniplanetarium for the evening and engaged the audience with images projected onto the walls and ceiling and with the help of local children demonstrated the expanse of the solar system by using fruit  doug jones mon 19112012 1242pm  ','0');
