8am  ','0'),('413','en','node_search',' just what do graphic designers do all day  just what do graphic designers do all day  pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau a talk by paul martin that explains 39 what he does 39 how he does it and what his sources of inspiration are doug jones tue 2042013 900am  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('414','en','node_search',' chalk talk and walk and a new pond for buriton  chalk talk and walk and a new pond for buriton  chalktalkandwalkjpg about 30 villagers and families attended the special event in the village hall in february to learn about how we should manage a special little nature reserve like the buriton chalk pits doug jones tue 2042013 902am  ','0'),('415','en','node_search',' charity walk is a boost for books charity walk is a boost for books shipwrightsafterphotojpg sponsored walkers from buriton were amongst the first to set foot along the shipwrights way in march following an official opening ceremony doug jones tue 2042013 903am  ','0'),('416','en','node_search',' guided birdsong walk through buriton chalk pits guided birdsong walk through buriton chalk pits pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau spend an enchanting evening in one of our local nature reserves and emerge much wiser about the distinctive bird songs of many of our local species doug jones tue 2042013 905am  ','0'),('417','en','node_search',' more local history deposited in winchester more local history deposited in winchester goodyer20png trustees of a local charity set up over 300 years ago have recently deposited many of their records at the hampshire records office in winchester doug jones tue 2042013 907am  ','0'),('418','en','node_search',' bluebell walk and farm tea at bolinge hill farm bluebell walk and farm tea at bolinge hill farm pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau an opportunity for parishioners family and friends to take a delightful guided stroll along farm paths not normally open to the public and opportunities weather permitting to see thousands of bluebells and impressive early purple orchids doug jones thu 4042013 924pm  ','0'),('419','en','node_search','  21 today parish council encourages more kissing  21 today parish council encourages more kissing kissinggate5jpg miles and miles without stiles over the last four years with cooperation from landowners the parish council has been able to remove 21 stiles to make things easier for elderly people for young families and people walking with dogs doug jones thu 4042013 935pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('420','en','node_search',' parish campout on the recreation ground parish campout on the recreation ground pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau all are welcome at buriton 39 s popular annual 39 campout 39 on the recreation ground commencing on saturday 20th july and camping overnight until about 1pm on sunday 21st  doug jones mon 27052013 722pm  ','0'),('421','en','node_search',' gold crest and black cap are top tweets gold crest and black cap are top tweets goldcrest1jpg our guide di mitchell assured us that birds would be singing in spite of a bit of light drizzle and she was right  doug jones mon 27052013 727pm  ','0'),('422','en','node_search',' chalk pits activity day chalk pits activity day pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau activities for all age groups art activities bug hunts family quizzes and guided walks new for this year life in leaf litter microscopes will be available so that everyone can see the wide variety of creatures that live amongst the leaves on the floor of the nature reserve doug jones mon 27052013 730pm  ','0'),('423','en','node_search',' art trail saturday 15th and sunday 16th june art trail saturday 15th and sunday 16th june pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau local artists local venues local food  doug jones sun 2062013 619pm  ','0'),('424','en','node_search',' art trail saturday 15th and sunday 16th june art trail saturday 15th and sunday 16th june pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau local artists local venues local food  doug jones sun 2062013 621pm  ','0'),('425','en','node_search',' goodnight mister tom 12th 15th june in petersfield festival hall goodnight mister tom 12th 15th june in petersfield festival hall mistertom2jpg following michelle magorian s talk in buriton earlier in the year here s a chance to see a musical version of her awardwinning novel doug jones sun 2062013 625pm  ','0'),('426','en','node_search',' buriton coronation picture to feature in countywide celebrations buriton coronation picture to feature in countywide celebrations coronationpicture977ecompjpg as part of the county s activities to mark the 60th anniversary of the queen s coronation there will be a special service of celebration in winchester cathedral doug jones sun 2062013 627pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('427','en','node_search',' buriton school summer fair with wild west theme buriton school summer fair with wild west theme pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau saturday 22nd june 12 til 230pm on the recreation ground doug jones sun 16062013 558pm  ','0'),('428','en','node_search',' seniors afternoon tea down on the farm seniors afternoon tea down on the farm pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau prebooking is essential please see details below doug jones sun 16062013 610pm  ','0'),('429','en','node_search',' management plan for nature reserve takes shape management plan for nature reserve takes shape chalkpitsplannersimg0023jpg with the three years of lottery funding drawing towards its close volunteers are putting the finishing touches to their plans to look after the chalk pits nature reserve over the years ahead doug jones sun 16062013 625pm  ','0'),('430','en','node_search',' ramblers enjoy delights of buriton nature reserves ramblers enjoy delights of buriton nature reserves ramblersimg0030jpg the petersfield ramblers group made a special visit to buriton in june to look at the nature reserves at coulters dean and in the buriton chalk pits doug jones sun 16062013 639pm  ','0'),('431','en','node_search',' more improvements to living conditions and education in ghana more improvements to living conditions and education in ghana dominasebooksimg9647ejpg there is more good news to report from dominase thanks to money raised by the buritonbased villagetovillage charity doug jones sun 16062013 659pm  ','0'),('432','en','node_search',' buriton book is a big hit in africa buriton book is a big hit in africa bookdominasejpg villagers in buriton s adopted community of dominase thousands of miles away in darkest africa are now learning more about life in buriton doug jones sun 16062013 717pm  ','0'),('433','en','node_search',' buriton featured in national park news buriton featured in national park news nationalparknews2cjpg some of the community activities that have taken place in the parish in recent years are featured in the south downs national park s latest newspaper doug jones sun 21072013 337pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('434','en','node_search',' farm tea goes down well farm tea goes down well teaatbolingehillfarmimg0231cjpg susan shone put on a special spread for senior citizens from across the parish in july an established part of the community s annual down on our farms programme of events open days walks and talks doug jones sun 21072013 342pm  ','0'),('435','en','node_search',' team hawaii are top bananas team hawaii are top bananas tennis2013daviscupwinningteamhawaiijpg over 40 members of buriton tennis club took part in their annual fancy dress davis cup competition dressed to represent teams from france hawaii new zealand and the usa doug jones sun 21072013 347pm  ','0'),('436','en','node_search',' buriton s calendar for 2014 your chance to feature  buriton s calendar for 2014 your chance to feature  calendar2ajpg the community s 2013 calendar was far more popular than initially envisaged so the organisers are doing the same thing for 2014 and want even more people to take photographs for consideration doug jones sun 21072013 349pm  ','0'),('437','en','node_search',' films for autumn 2013 films for autumn 2013 filmflyeredit233percentjpg an excellent series of films has been arranged for the autumn of 2013 with some very recently released films and there is also an extra film this season with a special introduction by awardwinning author michelle magorian doug jones mon 26082013 1012am  ','0'),('438','en','node_search',' summer in february summer in february pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau starring dan stevens from downton abbey this brand new film only released in june this year is a british period drama set in edwardian cornwall doug jones mon 26082013 1016am  ','0'),('439','en','node_search',' english vinglish english vinglish pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau english vinglish is a 2012 indian comedydrama film shot mostly in new york which captures the inherent struggle of many people all over the world with the english language hilarious touching and sensitive  doug jones mon 26082013 1019am  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('440','en','node_search',' behind the candelabra behind the candelabra pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau a brilliant performance by michael douglas illuminates an affectionate and funny portrait of the flamboyant entertainer liberace in another 2013 film coming swiftly to buriton doug jones mon 26082013 1024am  ','0'),('441','en','node_search',' harvest flower festival harvest flower festival pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau reviving a lovely old tradition st mary 39 s church will be full of flowers and open for viewing on friday 4th saturday 5th and sunday 6th october doug jones mon 26082013 1027am  ','0'),('442','en','node_search',' harvest flower festival harvest flower festival pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau reviving a lovely old tradition st mary 39 s church will be full of flowers and open for viewing on friday 4th saturday 5th and sunday 6th october doug jones mon 26082013 1029am  ','0'),('443','en','node_search',' harvest flower festival harvest flower festival pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau reviving a lovely old tradition st mary 39 s church will be full of flowers and open for viewing on friday 4th saturday 5th and sunday 6th october doug jones mon 26082013 1030am  ','0'),('444','en','node_search',' calendar girls sold out calendar girls sold out pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau all 120 tickets for friday s performance of buriton 39 s own production of this highly regarded play were snapped up within a matter of days the play recreates the true story surrounding the creation of an 39 alternative 39 34 not naked but nude 34 calendar by the women 39 s institute of knapeley in the yorkshire dales all profits from the buriton performances will go to leukemia research doug jones mon 26082013 1033am  ','0'),('445','en','node_search',' calendar girls sold out calendar girls sold out pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau all 120 tickets for saturday s performance of buriton 39 s own production of this highly regarded play were snapped up within a matter of days the play recreates the true story surrounding the creation of an 39 alternative 39 34 not naked but nude 34 calendar by the women 39 s institute of knapeley in the yorkshire dales all profits from the buriton performances will go to leukemia research doug jones mon 26082013 1034am  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('447','en','node_search',' researching the anniversaries of the first world war and of dday researching the anniversaries of the first world war and of dday poppyjpg finding out about buriton s first world war and dday history can you help  doug jones mon 26082013 1042am  ','0'),('450','en','node_search',' fantastic festival of flowers fantastic festival of flowers flowerfestival2014jpg visitors flocked to st mary s church to view the harvestthemed flower festival doug jones sat 2112013 1050am  ','0'),('451','en','node_search',' bee talk generates a buzz bee talk generates a buzz bee70jpg bees are absolutely vital to our lives they don t just make honey but play a critical role in the production of all sorts of foodstuffs from fruit and veg to meat and dairy doug jones sat 2112013 1052am  ','0'),('452','en','node_search',' around the world in 80 minutes around the world in 80 minutes downlandconcert20145ejpg lighthearted lyrics memorable melodies and clever choreography helped ensure a memorable concert in st mary s church on sunday 20th october doug jones sat 2112013 1057am  ','0'),('453','en','node_search',' just what do graphic designers do all day  just what do graphic designers do all day  pmforwebsite0jpg over sixty people packed into the village hall on a very wet and windy night to be entertained by a witty and informative talk the autumn meeting of the buriton village association doug jones sat 2112013 1100am  ','0'),('454','en','node_search',' restoration of old pond gets underway restoration of old pond gets underway chalkpitspondoct2013img0666jpg the parish council s project to encourage more wildlife in the chalk pits nature reserve whilst providing an attractive place for local walkers to pause for a rest commenced in october doug jones sat 2112013 1102am  ','0'),('455','en','node_search','  back home raises 170 for children far away  back home raises 170 for children far away backhome2jpg after her popular and inspirational talk in the village in february awardwinning author michelle magorian returned to buriton to introduce a film adaptation of her book back home  doug jones sat 2112013 1105am  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('456','en','node_search',' buriton calendar for 2014 on sale now buriton calendar for 2014 on sale now calendar2014jpg copies of a brand new buriton parish calendar for 2014 are now available at only 7 per copy the new calendar makes a perfect christmas present for family and friends doug jones sat 2112013 1108am  ','0'),('457','en','node_search',' buriton christmas market buriton christmas market pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau want something different for christmas ever struggle with christmas gift ideas dislike the christmas madness on the high street  doug jones wed 27112013 344pm  ','0'),('458','en','node_search',' carols round the pond carols round the pond pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau come and join the merry throng followed by mince pies refreshments and more carols in the church doug jones wed 27112013 345pm  ','0'),('459','en','node_search',' songs for survivors songs for survivors pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau music to raise money for the philippines typhoon appeal in buriton village hall doug jones wed 27112013 350pm  ','0'),('460','en','node_search',' give gifts to the philippines give gifts to the philippines philippines1jpg there has already been amazing support for the parish council st mary s church give gifts to the philippines appeal in the wake of typhoon haiyan but more supplies are always welcomed doug jones wed 27112013 354pm  ','0'),('461','en','node_search',' buriton s calendar girls raise over 3000 for charity buriton s calendar girls raise over 3000 for charity calendargirlsburiton2013cjpg in front of over 250 people in two sellout nights a group of brave buriton women bared all as they followed in the footsteps of hollywood stars helen mirren and julie walters to raise thousands of pounds for charity doug jones wed 27112013 356pm  ','0'),('462','en','node_search',' a unique christmas present a unique christmas present bookxmasposteredit4jpg a few copies of this remarkable book are available and make great christmas presents for anyone connected to buriton children family and friends doug jones wed 27112013 358pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('463','en','node_search',' flooding in buriton village hall flooding in buriton village hall villagehall6jpg unfortunately the village hall was flooded in the prechristmas storms work is underway to get the building fully operational again as soon as possible for up to date information please visit the village hall website  http wwwburitonvillagehallcouk  doug jones fri 3012014 709pm  ','0'),('464','en','node_search',' parish council meeting parish council meeting pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau buriton parish council meets every alternate month throughout the year all meetings take place in the village hall starting at 7pm with an opportunity for members of the public to ask questions or make comments in the public forum at 745pm doug jones thu 9012014 1230pm  ','0'),('466','en','node_search',' parish council meeting parish council meeting pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau buriton parish council meets every alternate month throughout the year all meetings take place in the village hall starting at 7pm with an opportunity for members of the public to ask questions or make comments in the public forum at 745pm doug jones thu 9012014 1244pm  ','0'),('467','en','node_search',' parish council meeting parish council meeting pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau buriton parish council meets every alternate month throughout the year all meetings take place in the village hall starting at 7pm with an opportunity for members of the public to ask questions or make comments in the public forum at 745pm doug jones thu 9012014 1245pm  ','0'),('469','en','node_search',' parish council meeting parish council meeting pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau buriton parish council meets every alternate month throughout the year meetings usually take place in the village hall but due to repairs this meeting will take place in the seward room at st mary s church starting at 7pm the usual opportunity for members of the public to ask questions or make comments in the public forum will take place at 745pm doug jones thu 9012014 1247pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('470','en','node_search',' parish council meeting parish council meeting pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau buriton parish council meets every alternate month throughout the year all meetings take place in the village hall starting at 7pm with an opportunity for members of the public to ask questions or make comments in the public forum at 745pm doug jones thu 9012014 1249pm  ','0'),('471','en','node_search',' parish council meeting parish council meeting pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau buriton parish council meets every alternate month throughout the year all meetings take place in the village hall starting at 7pm with an opportunity for members of the public to ask questions or make comments in the public forum at 745pm doug jones thu 9012014 1252pm  ','0'),('472','en','node_search',' annual parish meeting annual parish meeting pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau the annual meeting of buriton parish council including a review of the most recent year april 2013 march 2014 and issues for the forthcoming year to march 2015 the parish council will also consider the current planning applications for buriton manor this meeting will take place in st mary s church whilst the village hall is closed following flood damage doug jones thu 9012014 117pm  ','0'),('473','en','node_search',' parish magazine deadline for next edition parish magazine deadline for next edition buriton parish magazine is produced four times every year with editions in spring summer autumn and winter the spring edition will be circulated in the first week of march and will cover all events for march april and may to contact the editors steve kirsty thomas simply send an email to this address  buritonmagazine yahoocom doug jones thu 9012014 219pm  ','0'),('474','en','node_search',' parish magazine deadline for next edition parish magazine deadline for next edition buriton parish magazine is produced four times every year with editions in spring summer autumn and winter the summer edition will be circulated in the first week of june and will cover all events for june july and august to contact the editors steve kirsty thomas simply send an email to this address  buritonmagazine yahoocom doug jones thu 9012014 221pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('475','en','node_search',' parish magazine deadline for next edition parish magazine deadline for next edition buriton parish magazine is produced four times every year with editions in spring summer autumn and winter the autumn edition will be circulated in the first week of september and will cover all events for september october and november to contact the editors steve kirsty thomas simply send an email to this address  buritonmagazine yahoocom doug jones thu 9012014 222pm  ','0'),('476','en','node_search',' parish magazine deadline for next edition parish magazine deadline for next edition buriton parish magazine is produced four times every year with editions in spring summer autumn and winter the winter edition will be circulated in the first week of december and will cover all events for december january and february to contact the editors steve kirsty thomas simply send an email to this address  buritonmagazine yahoocom doug jones thu 9012014 223pm  ','0'),('477','en','node_search','  blue jasmine in the village hall  blue jasmine in the village hall pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau cate blanchett oscar nominee for best actress for her role in this film is directed by woody allen in a highly acclaimed and very successful drama with an excellent supporting cast including sally hawkins alec baldwin and toni collette and some great shots of san francisco doug jones thu 9012014 358pm  ','0'),('478','en','node_search','  philomena in the village hall postponed to april 4th  philomena in the village hall postponed to april 4th pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau judy dench is an irishwoman searching for the son taken from her as a baby steve coogan is a journalist assisting her in her quest funny and sad and beautifully done on all levels doug jones thu 9012014 404pm  ','0'),('480','en','node_search',' moth evening in the buriton chalk pits moth evening in the buriton chalk pits pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau take part in a moth survey as part of this year 39 s bioblitz being organised by the queen elizabeth country park doug jones thu 9012014 422pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('481','en','node_search',' open day in buriton chalk pits as part of a bioblitz being organised by the queen elizabeth country park open day in buriton chalk pits as part of a bioblitz being organised by the queen elizabeth country park pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau come and help us to find what is growing wriggling flying and singing in the chalk pits nature reserve doug jones thu 9012014 423pm  ','0'),('482','en','node_search',' films for spring 2014 films for spring 2014 filmflyeredit233percentjpg an excellent series of films has been arranged for the spring of 2014 with some very recently released films and international award nominees doug jones thu 9012014 436pm  ','0'),('483','en','node_search',' the making of war horse the making of war horse pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau special adviser on the speilberg film war horse andy robertshaw will give a fascinating insight into the making of a major blockbuster movie as well as unique knowledge about the role of horses in the conflicts of the first world war specially arranged for halfterm week this talk will appeal to adults and children of all ages doug jones thu 9012014 519pm  ','0'),('484','en','node_search',' dday buriton and beyond dday buriton and beyond pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau 70 years ago hundreds of allied troops were camped in and around the parish in the build up to the dday landings and operation overlord buriton village association is working in partnership with the dday museum in southsea to find out as much as possible about this period of local history and a special evening talk will be held on tuesday 10th june doug jones thu 9012014 526pm  ','0'),('485','en','node_search',' what makes buriton special  what makes buriton special  pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau local expert nick heasman will explain many things that make the countryside and community of buriton very special from the wonderful starry night skies above our heads to the huge natural reservoir of the chalk rocks below our feet via all the special plants trees and wildlife all around us very few parts of the planet are special enough to be included in national parks buriton is one of those special places  doug jones thu 9012014 535pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('487','en','node_search','  titus a play by monica ditmas  titus a play by monica ditmas pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau saint paul had since his conversion on the road to damascus spent ten years as an evangelist to the gentiles before being taken to rome and his death he had planted churches in many roman provinces this play reading will provide a rare opportunity to hear a modern interpretation of these events and times anonymous not verified thu 16012014 1122am  ','0'),('488','en','node_search',' bluebell walk and farm tea at bolinge hill farm bluebell walk and farm tea at bolinge hill farm pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau an opportunity for parishioners family and friends to take a delightful guided stroll along farm paths not normally open to the public and opportunities weather permitting to see thousands of bluebells and impressive early purple orchids doug jones sun 2022014 505pm  ','0'),('489','en','node_search',' bygone buriton local history exhibition bygone buriton local history exhibition pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau hundreds of photographs of the parish in years gone by free exhibition from 11am to 4pm this year in st mary s church due to ongoing repair work in the village hall doug jones sun 2022014 513pm  ','0'),('490','en','node_search',' quiz night quiz night pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau buriton tennis club is holding its regular quiz night in the maple inn this year and all are welcome doug jones sun 2022014 517pm  ','0'),('491','en','node_search',' fungi foray in buriton chalk pits fungi foray in buriton chalk pits pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau a guided walk led by hampshire expert rosemary webb meet at the halls hill car park at 10am nb this is a rearranged date this event was originally planned for 18 october  doug jones sun 2022014 523pm  ','0'),('492','en','node_search','  our brave boys of buriton   our brave boys of buriton  pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau a quiet evening of poems and prose from a hundred years ago some by local residents and servicemen commemorating the start of four years of world war doug jones sun 2022014 528pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('493','en','node_search','  lights out over europe   lights out over europe  pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau an illustrated talk about sir edward grey foreign secretary at the outbreak of the first world war will provide background to the buildup to the conflict and insights into sir edward 39 s many links with hampshire doug jones sun 2022014 531pm  ','0'),('494','en','node_search',' is this a public footpath  is this a public footpath  rowconsultationmapjpg hampshire county council is consulting the community to find out whether this route at ditcham wood near coulters dean should be recorded as a public footpath doug jones sun 2022014 555pm  ','0'),('495','en','node_search',' buriton dday and beyond buriton dday and beyond ddayreunionforwebsitejpg buriton has been chosen as one of four small communities from hampshire to take part in a special d day at 70 project and your help is being sought doug jones sun 2022014 603pm  ','0'),('496','en','node_search','  philomena in the village hall rescheduled from 7th march  philomena in the village hall rescheduled from 7th march pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau judy dench is an irishwoman searching for the son taken from her as a baby steve coogan is a journalist assisting her in her quest funny and sad and beautifully done on all levels doug jones wed 5032014 644pm  ','0'),('497','en','node_search',' village show village show pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau buriton s popular annual village show including flowers fruit vegetables baking and arts crafts this year in three special venues details below  doug jones sun 16032014 238pm  ','0'),('498','en','node_search',' what the quiz night postponed to saturday 22nd november at ditcham tithe barn  what the quiz night postponed to saturday 22nd november at ditcham tithe barn  pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau the antidote to ordinary quiz nights  doug jones sun 16032014 241pm  ','0'),('500','en','node_search',' petersfield society features buriton s new pond petersfield society features buriton s new pond chalkpitspondimg1757jpg winter newsletter praises work to restore the old pond at buriton chalk pits doug jones sun 16032014 309pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('501','en','node_search',' latest news about loos latest news about loos dominasehouseholdtoiletcjpg villagers in buriton s adopted communuity of dominase in ghana are seeing more and more improvements in the health of the population particularly young children as as result of buriton s programme of sanitation projects doug jones sun 16032014 324pm  ','0'),('502','en','node_search',' children s dance project to feature buriton history children s dance project to feature buriton history ww1dancesoldierscjpg a unique event bringing together historians schoolchildren and dance professionals will be held in petersfield square this summer to commemorate the centenary of the outbreak of the first world war doug jones sun 16032014 350pm  ','0'),('503','en','node_search',' children s dance project to feature buriton history children s dance project to feature buriton history pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau a unique event bringing together historians schoolchildren and dance professionals will be held in petersfield square this summer to commemorate the centenary of the outbreak of the first world war doug jones sun 16032014 359pm  ','0'),('504','en','node_search',' prizes from reading competition presented at major independence day ceremony prizes from reading competition presented at major independence day ceremony dominasereadingprizegivingjpg buriton s charity villagetovillage group have successfully sponsored an interschool reading competition in and around dominase with hundreds of children taking part doug jones sun 16032014 420pm  ','0'),('505','en','node_search',' another block of toilets at another village school another block of toilets at another village school dominasekakytoiletjpg money from buriton has provided scores of children with somewhere safe and clean to go to the loo during school time which in turn helps to boost attendances  doug jones sun 16032014 442pm  ','0'),('506','en','node_search',' shipwrights way sculptures unveiled in the parish shipwrights way sculptures unveiled in the parish shipwrightscheesesnailimg25930jpg the rare cheese snail which lives in the buriton chalk pits is now celebrated in portland stone and two other sculptures on this new long distance walking and cycling route can also be found in the parish doug jones sun 16032014 557pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('507','en','node_search',' books boost children s chances in dominase books boost children s chances in dominase dominasereadingbooksimg2065jpg buriton s villagetovillage link with dominase has recently delivered over 1000 supplementary reading books to hundreds of cheering schoolchildren doug jones sun 16032014 615pm  ','0'),('508','en','node_search',' new geotrail leaflets describe walks through time  new geotrail leaflets describe walks through time  geoleaflets4combinedjpg two new leaflets produced by buriton parish council provide an insight into 100 million years of history and explain how the rocks beneath us not only create the landscapes and scenery in the parish but also influence the natural vegetation wildlife agriculture and industrial history of the area doug jones sun 16032014 638pm  ','0'),('509','en','node_search',' buriton art trail 2014 buriton art trail 2014 pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau this popular event returns on saturday 7 and sunday 8 june from 200 600 on both days a wide variety of work by local creatives in 5 venues including the five bells and the manor barn doug jones thu 10042014 851pm  ','0'),('510','en','node_search',' evening birdsong walk evening birdsong walk pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau spend an enchanting evening in one of our local nature reserves and emerge much wiser about the distinctive bird songs of many of our local species doug jones thu 10042014 854pm  ','0'),('511','en','node_search',' dawn chorus walk saturday 3 may dawn chorus walk saturday 3 may pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau a chance to hear some wonderful bird song on a dawn chorus walk through the buriton chalk pits doug jones thu 10042014 858pm  ','0'),('512','en','node_search',' parish calendar 2015 your chance to be featured parish calendar 2015 your chance to be featured calendar2014jpg due to the overwhelming response and interest in the calendar for 2014 the organisers have decided to do the same thing for 2015 and want even more people to take photographs for consideration doug jones thu 10042014 902pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('513','en','node_search',' buriton art trail 2014 buriton art trail 2014 pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau this popular event returns on saturday 7 and sunday 8 june from 200 600 on both days a wide variety of work by local creatives in 5 venues including the five bells and the manor barn doug jones thu 10042014 903pm  ','0'),('514','en','node_search',' vintage tennis afternoon vintage tennis afternoon pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau tennis fun with afternoon tea open to members and nonmembers of buriton tennis club sunday 18 may doug jones wed 23042014 153pm  ','0'),('515','en','node_search',' seniors afternoon tea down on the farm seniors afternoon tea down on the farm pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau prebooking is essential please see details below doug jones tue 13052014 501pm  ','0'),('516','en','node_search',' buriton s dday history unveiled buriton s dday history unveiled ddaycjpg some of buriton s connections with the famous dday campaign 70 years ago were unveiled at a major conference in portsmouth recently doug jones tue 13052014 511pm  ','0'),('517','en','node_search',' buriton cc vs red lion buriton cc vs red lion spectators welcome anonymous not verified mon 19052014 911pm  ','0'),('518','en','node_search',' buriton cc vs tfl buriton cc vs tfl copme and see buriton take on the might of boris johnson s tfl dinos anonymous not verified mon 19052014 922pm  ','0'),('519','en','node_search',' buriton cc vs dacd rowlands castle  buriton cc vs dacd rowlands castle spectators welcome anonymous not verified mon 19052014 924pm  ','0'),('520','en','node_search',' buriton cc vs south harting buriton cc vs south harting a 2020 evening game anonymous not verified mon 19052014 926pm  ','0'),('521','en','node_search',' buriton cc vs elsted buriton cc vs elsted spectators always welcome anonymous not verified mon 19052014 927pm  ','0'),('522','en','node_search',' buriton cc vs po