photo  doug jones sun 10082014 357pm  ','0'),('541','en','node_search',' convicts steal davis cup trophy convicts steal davis cup trophy daviscupwinners2014jpg the tennis club s popular davis cup competition this year came with some extra twists doug jones mon 1092014 158pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('542','en','node_search',' war memorial decorated to mark anniversary of first world war war memorial decorated to mark anniversary of first world war warmemforwebsitejpg visitors and residents alike remarked on the way that the parish s war memorial was enhanced to mark the 100th anniversary of the outbreak of the first world war one of a series of thoughtful events being held in the community doug jones mon 1092014 204pm  ','0'),('543','en','node_search',' our brave boys of buriton centenary marked in poetry and prose our brave boys of buriton centenary marked in poetry and prose ww1poppiesimg4301jpg as the nation remembered the anniversary of the events of august 1914 and thereafter the occasion was marked in buriton with a quiet evening of wartime poems and prose including some written by local servicemen and residents doug jones mon 1092014 206pm  ','0'),('544','en','node_search',' the show goes on successful village show held in three venues this year the show goes on successful village show held in three venues this year villageshow2014img4454ejpg with the village hall unavailable the organisers of the annual village show put their thinking caps on and came up with a winning formula doug jones mon 1092014 208pm  ','0'),('545','en','node_search',' buriton christmas market buriton christmas market pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau want something different for christmas ever struggle with christmas gift ideas dislike the christmas madness on the high street  doug jones fri 5092014 848pm  ','0'),('546','en','node_search',' planning application for change of use of maple inn with two new dwellings planning application for change of use of maple inn with two new dwellings mapleplanningappimg4493cjpg the parish council has learnt that a planning application has been submitted to change the use of the maple inn into a bed breakfast establishment with the construction of two new detached dwellings in the current garden and car park there are a number of opportunities to have your say doug jones tue 9092014 854am  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('547','en','node_search',' the love punch the love punch pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau comedy film in buriton 39 s new cinema doug jones wed 1102014 351pm  ','0'),('548','en','node_search',' mr morgan s last love mr morgan s last love pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau romantic drama film in buriton 39 s new cinema doug jones wed 1102014 353pm  ','0'),('549','en','node_search',' belle unfortunately cancelled due to lack of venue belle unfortunately cancelled due to lack of venue pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau period drama film in buriton 39 s new cinema doug jones wed 1102014 355pm  ','0'),('550','en','node_search',' village hall to reopen in the new year village hall to reopen in the new year hallbvhslide03jpg the hall floor is now dry and the parish council has begun to schedule the repairs doug jones wed 1102014 359pm  ','0'),('551','en','node_search',' buriton invited to take part in search for historic gems buriton invited to take part in search for historic gems lidar 2jpg the south downs national park authority is encouraging community groups to uncover the hidden historic gems of the local landscape and volunteers from buriton are already on board doug jones wed 1102014 400pm  ','0'),('552','en','node_search',' big fire in weston recalled big fire in weston recalled heritageexhibition2014jpg almost 200 visitors flocked to buriton church on saturday 27th september 2014 for the annual bygone buriton exhibition including families from across the country doug jones wed 1102014 403pm  ','0'),('553','en','node_search',' buriton calendars for 2015 now on sale buriton calendars for 2015 now on sale calendar 2015jpg copies of a brand new buriton parish calendar for 2015 are now available at only 750 per copy the new calendar makes a perfect christmas present for family and friends doug jones wed 1102014 405pm  ','0'),('554','en','node_search',' what the quiz night what the quiz night pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau the antidote to ordinary quiz nights saturday 22 november 730pm book soon doug jones wed 1102014 409pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('555','en','node_search',' buriton and the first world war buriton and the first world war ww1 logo 2jpg launch of a local project to find out more about the impacts of the fouryear conflict on life at home and to find out what happened to each of the 193 men who left the parish to take part in the war doug jones mon 13102014 909am  ','0'),('556','en','node_search',' behind the scenes of war horse behind the scenes of war horse warhorse2fortalkjpg an audience of over sixty villagers and friends were highly entertained by andrew robertshaw s illustrated talk about the making of war horse in october doug jones sat 15112014 316pm  ','0'),('557','en','node_search',' dead man s fingers found in buriton chalk pits dead man s fingers found in buriton chalk pits fungi2014jpg october s fungi foray was enjoyed by many local residents with all manner of weird and wonderful species being found doug jones sat 15112014 318pm  ','0'),('558','en','node_search',' coincidences mark 100th anniversary coincidences mark 100th anniversary monmouthjpg how an article in the parish magazine led to the discovery of some fascinating local coincidences doug jones sat 15112014 320pm  ','0'),('559','en','node_search',' abattoir changes may kill off buriton s community cow scheme abattoir changes may kill off buriton s community cow scheme beefstory2jpg too much red tape is being blamed for the demise of a local food project in buriton but villagers want to carry on if they can doug jones sat 15112014 324pm  ','0'),('560','en','node_search',' first world war grave restored in time for remembrance day first world war grave restored in time for remembrance day kitegraveafterimg5030jpg a neglected plot in buriton churchyard has been restored with help from an anonymous donor doug jones sat 15112014 327pm  ','0'),('561','en','node_search',' chipolatas cocktail sausages and much more available on tuesday 23rd december afternoon 2 6pm  chipolatas cocktail sausages and much more available on tuesday 23rd december afternoon 2 6pm  pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau christmas meat from one of your local farms pork and lamb hogget joints bacon sausages etc anonymous not verified mon 22122014 612pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('564','en','node_search',' quiz raises money to buy 1000 books for schoolchildren in ghana quiz raises money to buy 1000 books for schoolchildren in ghana dominasequiz2015jpg buriton s annual antidote to ordinary quiz nights launched a new regular giving initiative for the community s link with dominase and raised almost 1000 for west african children doug jones sat 7022015 1019pm  ','0'),('565','en','node_search',' buriton and the first world war buriton and the first world war ww1 logo 2jpg action at home and abroad 100 years ago doug jones sat 7022015 1023pm  ','0'),('566','en','node_search',' parish council meeting parish council meeting pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau buriton parish council meets every alternate month throughout the year all meetings take place in the village hall starting at 7pm with an opportunity for members of the public to ask questions or make comments in the public forum at 745pm doug jones sat 7022015 1025pm  ','0'),('567','en','node_search',' parish council meeting parish council meeting pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau buriton parish council meets every alternate month throughout the year this meeting may 2015 will also be the occasion for the annual parish meeting doug jones sat 7022015 1026pm  ','0'),('568','en','node_search',' parish council meeting parish council meeting pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau buriton parish council meets every alternate month throughout the year all meetings take place in the village hall starting at 7pm with an opportunity for members of the public to ask questions or make comments in the public forum at 745pm doug jones sat 7022015 1026pm  ','0'),('569','en','node_search',' parish council meeting parish council meeting pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau buriton parish council meets every alternate month throughout the year all meetings take place in the village hall starting at 7pm with an opportunity for members of the public to ask questions or make comments in the public forum at 745pm doug jones sat 7022015 1027pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('570','en','node_search',' parish council meeting parish council meeting pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau buriton parish council meets every alternate month throughout the year all meetings take place in the village hall starting at 7pm with an opportunity for members of the public to ask questions or make comments in the public forum at 745pm doug jones sat 7022015 1027pm  ','0'),('571','en','node_search',' parish magazine deadline for next edition parish magazine deadline for next edition buriton parish magazine is produced four times every year with editions in spring summer autumn and winter the spring edition will be circulated in the first week of march and will cover all events for march april and may to contact the editors steve kirsty thomas simply send an email to this address  buritonmagazine yahoocom doug jones sat 7022015 1029pm  ','0'),('572','en','node_search',' parish magazine deadline for next edition parish magazine deadline for next edition buriton parish magazine is produced four times every year with editions in spring summer autumn and winter the autumn edition will be circulated in the first week of september and will cover all events for september october and november to contact the editors steve kirsty thomas simply send an email to this address  buritonmagazine yahoocom doug jones sat 7022015 1029pm  ','0'),('573','en','node_search',' parish magazine deadline for next edition parish magazine deadline for next edition buriton parish magazine is produced four times every year with editions in spring summer autumn and winter the winter edition will be circulated in the first week of december and will cover all events for december january and february to contact the editors steve kirsty thomas simply send an email to this address  buritonmagazine yahoocom doug jones sat 7022015 1030pm  ','0'),('574','en','node_search',' parish magazine deadline for next edition parish magazine deadline for next edition buriton parish magazine is produced four times every year with editions in spring summer autumn and winter the summer edition will be circulated in the first week of june and will cover all events for june july and august to contact the editors steve kirsty thomas simply send an email to this address  buritonmagazine yahoocom doug jones sat 7022015 1031pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('575','en','node_search',' buriton tennis club s regular quiz night is returning to the village hall this year after a successful run at the maple inn and all are welcome buriton tennis club s regular quiz night is returning to the village hall this year after a successful run at the maple inn and all are welcome pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau this is always a very popular social event so please book your places quickly 6 per person doug jones sat 7022015 1034pm  ','0'),('576','en','node_search',' tennis club barn dance at tithe farm all are welcome tennis club barn dance at tithe farm all are welcome pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau buriton tennis club is holding a midsummer barn dance in one of the barns at tithe house courtesy of maggie and ian johnson doug jones sat 7022015 1036pm  ','0'),('577','en','node_search',' village show village show pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau buriton s popular annual village show including flowers fruit vegetables baking and arts crafts entries in the morning showtime in the afternoon doug jones sat 7022015 1049pm  ','0'),('578','en','node_search',' lambing days at nursted farm lambing days at nursted farm pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau come and see all the new born lambs at nursted farm 2pm 430pm part of the down on buriton s farms programme of farm events open days walks and talks during 2015 doug jones sat 7022015 1051pm  ','0'),('579','en','node_search',' lambing days at nursted farm lambing days at nursted farm pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau come and see all the new born lambs at nursted farm 2pm 430pm part of the down on buriton s farms programme of farm events open days walks and talks during 2015 doug jones sat 7022015 1052pm  ','0'),('580','en','node_search',' lambing days at nursted farm lambing days at nursted farm pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau come and see all the new