INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('736','en','node_search',' buriton school summer fete buriton school summer fete school fete 2016jpg lots of fun on saturday 18th june doug jones sun 12062016 348pm  ','0'),('737','en','node_search',' thank you from the plan b team thank you from the plan b team plan b logo for websitejpg the popin event in the village hall was very successful and all the comments made have now been studied doug jones sun 12062016 350pm  ','0'),('738','en','node_search',' scamalot scamalot burglar 2jpg recent reports from the police are warning people about a range of scams doug jones sun 12062016 354pm  ','0'),('739','en','node_search',' would you like to join petersfield s twinning links with barentin  would you like to join petersfield s twinning links with barentin  twinning barentinjpg the organisers of petersfield s links are keen to involve people in surrounding villages to match the involvement across the channel doug jones sun 12062016 357pm  ','0'),('740','en','node_search',' buriton and the first world war what was happening 100 years ago  buriton and the first world war what was happening 100 years ago  ww1 logo 2jpg the latest instalment of this community project reveals what life was like in the parish in april june 1916 as well as describing the roles played by buriton men in the preparations for the battle of the somme at the battle of jutland and in some of the earliest airborne activities doug jones sun 12062016 358pm  ','0'),('743','en','node_search',' piano recital by tom cooper on sunday 10th july piano recital by tom cooper on sunday 10th july musicpng pieces by bach beethoven brahms and others in st mary s church at 230pm doug jones thu 30062016 302pm  ','0'),('745','en','node_search',' ride and stride an event in aid of local historic churches ride and stride an event in aid of local historic churches bellringing 2008 c1515143jpg an opportunity to take part and get sponsorship to cycle walk run or drive to as many local churches as possible or to sponsor someone else taking part doug jones thu 30062016 308pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('746','en','node_search',' antiques in your attic an entertaining talk by tv auctioneer jonathan pratt antiques in your attic an entertaining talk by tv auctioneer jonathan pratt jp black tie 2jpg a talk about jonathan s experiences as an auctioneer and his tv work followed by an opportunity to get comments on antiques brought along by the audience doug jones thu 30062016 311pm  ','0'),('748','en','node_search',' an evening of short talks about local involvement in the first world war an evening of short talks about local involvement in the first world war somme 4jpg a hundred years ago people in buriton were hearing about the largest battle in naval history and about the bloodiest day ever for the british army doug jones thu 30062016 313pm  ','0'),('751','en','node_search',' tchaikovsky at home tchaikovsky at home musicpng a programme of words and smallerscale musical pieces by the great russian composer in st mary s church doug jones sun 24072016 1053am  ','0'),('752','en','node_search',' first world war dead man s penny reveals sad stories first world war dead man s penny reveals sad stories ww1 charles leejpg when buritonborn margaret davis recently found a fiveinch bronze plaque inscribed in honour of charles lee amongst family possessions she had no idea of the sad stories it might be harbouring doug jones sun 24072016 1053am  ','0'),('753','en','node_search',' the bfg the bfg film bfgjpg steven spielberg s massive hit version of roald dahl s famous book needs no introduction  doug jones tue 2082016 1241pm  ','0'),('754','en','node_search',' our kind of traitor our kind of traitor film traitorjpg a thriller from the 2010 novel by john le carre moving from the era of cold war spying to the equally dark world of money laundering involving russian mafia and mi6 doug jones tue 2082016 1243pm  ','0'),('755','en','node_search',' love and friendship love and friendship film love and fjpg a clever adaptation of jane austen s novella lady susan with a mesmerising performance from kate beckinsale as notorious lady susan vernon doug jones tue 2082016 1245pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('756','en','node_search',' the jungle book the jungle book film the j bookjpg this wonderful remake of the old favourite features an allstar voice cast and amazing graphics whilst retaining the sense of magic and wonder doug jones tue 2082016 1248pm  ','0'),('757','en','node_search',' eddie the eagle eddie the eagle film eddie the ejpg based on the 1980s real life story of britain s hopeless but courageous skijumper and with a superb performance from taron egerton in the lead this film needs no introduction a real crowdpleaser  doug jones tue 2082016 1250pm  ','0'),('758','en','node_search',' golden years golden years film golden yearsjpg an ealingstyle comedy with a great array of british talent including bernard hill simon callow virginia mckenna una stubbs and phil davies doug jones tue 2082016 1252pm  ','0'),('759','en','node_search',' films in buriton the autumn season for 2016 films in buriton the autumn season for 2016 film flyer edit 2 33 percentjpg an excellent series of films has been arranged for the autumn of 2016  doug jones tue 2082016 1255pm  ','0'),('760','en','node_search',' special war graves focus at local heritage day special war graves focus at local heritage day cwgc picture1jpg local actor and comedian hugh dennis has teamed up with the commonwealth war graves commission to promote awareness of war graves here in britain and buriton will be featured doug jones tue 2082016 100pm  ','0'),('763','en','node_search',' a murder mystery evening a murder mystery evening murder mystery01jpg come and enjoy a murder mystery evening in the village hall staged by members of the lion and unicorn players and enjoy a delicious supper doug jones tue 2082016 134pm  ','0'),('766','en','node_search',' buriton bbq and family fun day buriton bbq and family fun day bbq fun day 2c jpg  10 for a family of 4 or 3 per person doug jones thu 4082016 603pm  ','0'),('767','en','node_search',' last chance to take photos for the 2017 parish calendar last chance to take photos for the 2017 parish calendar calendar 2015jpg due to the success of the buriton calendar over the last few years it s been decided to do it again and the closing date for entries is the day of the village show saturday 20th august doug jones thu 4082016 603pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('771','en','node_search',' post office all back to normal  post office all back to normal  postofficejpg please help ensure that the post office continues to visit buriton every week by visiting to buy stamps post parcels or tax your car  doug jones mon 29082016 927am  ','0'),('776','en','node_search',' hugh dennis to attend bygone buriton exhibition on saturday hugh dennis to attend bygone buriton exhibition on saturday hugh dennis ecjpg actor and comedian hugh dennis will be supporting the annual bygone buriton exhibition at st mary s church on september 24 featuring the community s involvement in the first world war doug jones sat 17092016 1253pm  ','0'),('777','en','node_search',' chalk pits trim burn learn day chalk pits trim burn learn day logo for websitejpg come along and help the country park s rangers with some vital habitat management doug jones wed 28092016 409pm  ','0'),('779','en','node_search',' chalk pits trim burn learn weekend chalk pits trim burn learn weekend logo for websitejpg come along and help the country park s rangers with some vital habitat management doug jones wed 28092016 411pm  ','0'),('780','en','node_search',' chalk pits trim burn learn weekend chalk pits trim burn learn weekend pachasapopruuacuhovistajotrichidrarudocukonotredau come along and help the country park 39 s rangers with some vital habitat management doug jones wed 28092016 411pm  ','0'),('781','en','node_search',' plan b for buriton another opportunity to have your say plan b for buriton another opportunity to have your say plan b logo for websitejpg pop into the village hall on saturday 15th october doug jones wed 28092016 413pm  ','0'),('782','en','node_search',' parish council backs dark skies reserve parish council backs dark skies reserve dark skies reserve 2jpg in may 2016 the south downs national park became the world s newest international dark sky reserve and the parish council is now hoping that all planning applications will help to protect the astonishing starstudded skies overhead doug jones wed 28092016 414pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('783','en','node_search',' help to design new war memorial feature help to design new war memorial feature war mem 2jpg the parish council owns the land to the rear of the war memorial and would like parishioners to design something to give thanks to all those who have helped the country in times of conflict not just in the armed forces but also helping the war effort at home in various important ways doug jones wed 28092016 415pm  ','0'),('784','en','node_search',' buriton and the first world war news about the somme 100 years ago buriton and the first world war news about the somme 100 years ago ww1 logo 2jpg the latest instalment of this community project reveals the roles played by buriton men during the battle of the somme as well as describing what life was like at home in the parish in the months of july august and september 1916 doug jones wed 28092016 416pm  ','0'),('785','en','node_search',' fascinating history of local a3 road to be revealed fascinating history of local a3 road to be revealed portsmouth roadjpg while travelling in traffic between buriton and portsmouth or northwards towards guildford have you ever thought that you are following one of the most important routes in british history  doug jones wed 28092016 418pm  ','0'),('786','en','node_search',' poignant stories from first world war recalled at buriton history exhibition poignant stories from first world war recalled at buriton history exhibition hugh dennis 2cjpg the graves of four first world war servicemen buried in st mary s churchyard were honoured as part of the community s annual bygone buriton exhibition in september doug jones wed 28092016 420pm  ','0'),('789','en','node_search',' any water pressure problems in buriton  any water pressure problems in buriton  water supply problemsjpg the parish council is in discussions with south east water about problems with water pressure in parts of the parish and you may be able to help doug jones wed 28092016 426pm  ','0'),('790','en','node_search',' updating buriton s village design statement updating buriton s village design statement dcjpg dozens of people took part in the special plan b workshop on saturday 15th october to help shape guidelines which planners use to look after the parish s special qualities doug jones sun 16102016 219pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('792','en','node_search',' buriton calendar for 2017 on sale now buriton calendar for 2017 on sale now f compilation 2jpg copies of a brand new buriton parish calendar for 2017 are now available at only 8 per copy the new calendar makes a perfect christmas present for family and friends doug jones sun 16102016 224pm  ','0'),('793','en','node_search','  secrets of the high wood revealed in buriton  secrets of the high wood revealed in buriton lidar 2jpg discoveries made after airborne laser scanning mapped part of the south downs national park that had been hidden under woodland for hundreds of years were described at the buriton village association autumn talk in october doug jones sat 22102016 107pm  ','0'),('794','en','node_search',' remember remember the 4th of november remember remember the 4th of november fireworks 2016jpg buriton s fireworks evening will be as funpacked as ever when the dark skies will be temporarily lit by the fantastic annual display and much more  doug jones sat 22102016 222pm  ','0'),('795','en','node_search',' village hall meeting village hall meeting hall edit 2jpg parishioners and users of the village hall are invited to a public meeting on tuesday 15th november to agree the future of the hall doug jones sun 6112016 656pm  ','0'),('796','en','node_search',' buriton s youth club buriton s youth club youth club for websitejpg did you know there was one read on for more details  doug jones tue 22112016 815am  ','0'),('797','en','node_search',' buriton s youth club buriton s youth club youth club for websitejpg buriton s youth club the countrysiders will meet at the five bells for their agm and a family quiz doug jones tue 22112016 817am  ','0'),('798','en','node_search',' buriton s youth club buriton s youth club youth club for websitejpg buriton s youth club the countrysiders will be doing a charity fundraising carol singing event doug jones tue 22112016 818am  ','0'),('799','en','node_search',' buriton s youth club buriton s youth club youth club for websitejpg buriton s youth club the countrysiders will be visiting the panto in petersfield doug jones tue 22112016 820am  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('800','en','node_search',' buriton and the first world war news from 100 years ago buriton and the first world war news from 100 years ago ww1logo2jpg the latest instalment of this community project reveals the roles played by buriton men during the last three months of 1916 amidst the terrible weather on the somme as well as describing what life was like at home in the parish at that time doug jones tue 22112016 823am  ','0'),('801','en','node_search',' conscientious objectors local tribunals and imprisonment conscientious objectors local tribunals and imprisonment consc 3jpg once hopes of a swift success on the western front in ww1 had been dashed the country was to face a prolonged war and conscription became a necessary step to boost the number of soldiers and hasten a victory doug jones tue 22112016 826am  ','0'),('802','en','node_search',' thefts from sheds and vehicles thefts from sheds and vehicles burglar2jpg recent reports from the police are warning people about a range of thefts and providing advice doug jones tue 22112016 828am  ','0'),('803','en','node_search',' carols round the pond carols round the pond christmascarols2jpg come and join the merry throng followed by mince pies refreshments and more carols in the church doug jones fri 25112016 652pm  ','0'),('804','en','node_search',' book launch one bird flying by monica ditmas book launch one bird flying by monica ditmas monicajpg you are warmly invited to the launch of monica s book at one tree books petersfield doug jones fri 25112016 654pm  ','0'),('807','en','node_search',' a united kingdom a united kingdom films 2017 a united kingdom for websitejpg laugh at its wry humour swoon at its romance and cheer its moments of triumph  doug jones sat 10122016 628pm  ','0'),('808','en','node_search',' the girl on the train the girl on the train films 2017 thegirlonthetrainmainquadjpg a commuter becomes entangled in a missing persons investigation that promises to send shockwaves through her life a nottobe missed thriller doug jones sat 10122016 630pm  ','0');
INSERT INTO `search_dataset` VALUES ('809','en','node_search',' bridget jones baby bridget jones baby films 2017 bridgetjonesonlineimage1jpg the latest film about bridget is sharp wellwritten and extremely funny doug jones sat 10122016 632pm  ','0'),('810','en','node_search',' i daniel blake i daniel blake films 2017 i daniel for website jpg winner of the palme d or at the 2016 cannes film festival a quietly fearsome piece of drama with ken loach s talent for humour running throughout doug jones sat 10122016 634pm  ','0'),('811','en','node_search',' films in buriton the spring season for 2017 films in buriton the spring season for 2017 filmflyeredit233percentjpg an excellent series of films has been arranged for the spring of 2017 doug jones sat 10122016 637pm  ','0'),('812','en','node_search',' canadian coin supports evidence of dday troops around buriton canadian coin supports evidence of dday troops around buriton 10e5cjpg a routine field survey by local metal detectorists has unearthed a canadian 1 cent coin in an area where allied troops are believed to have assembled in the weeks leading up to dday in 1944 doug jones sat 10122016 637pm  ','0'),('813','en','node_search',' latest news about buriton s help with sanitation in ghana arrives on world toilet day latest news about buriton s help with sanitation in ghana arrives on world toilet day 20161118072952jpg as well as the completion of another 70 family toilets work is well under way on the latest block of toilets for another village school doug jones sat 10122016 638pm  ','0'),('814','en','node_search',' parish council meeting parish council meeting buriton parish council meets every alternate month throughout the year all meetings take place in the village hall starting at 7pm with an opportunity for members of the public to ask questions or make comments in the public forum at 745pm more details about the parish council can be found elsewhere on this website  http wwwburitoninfo parishcouncil doug jones sat