parishcouncil doug jones sat 11112017 319pm  ','0'),('1250','en','node_search',' parish council meeting parish council meeting buriton parish council normally meets every alternate month throughout the year with meetings taking place in the upper hall buriton village hall starting at 7pm with an opportunity for members of the public to ask questions or make comments in the public forum at 745pm due to the current government restrictions on public meetings during the coronavirus outbreak buriton parish council has adopted alternative ways of working in order to continue with business whilst upholding democratic principles and compliance with the public health guidance if you have any queries about any parish council matter please continue to contact our clerk mrs petra norris in the normal way via 7943 536065 or buritonparishcouncil hotmailcouk  more details about the parish council can be found elsewhere on this website  http wwwburitoninfo parishcouncil doug jones sat 11112017 319pm  ','0');
